Simulated example datasets for test runs. All data are simulated as described in the corresponding paper.

Under an outcome prevalence of 0.2%, we provide example datasets for three scenarios:

1. NULL: none of the transcripts contains causal variants.
⋅⋅⋅⋅* `simrep1_S0_30_0.6.gds`, 
2. 60% of causal variants are assigned to the canonical transcript.
3. The canonical transcript contains all causal variants.

